g work across any domain. Create, list, switch, annotate, and filter projects by status and category. Data lives per-profile (~/.hermes/projects.yaml or ~/.hermes/profiles/<name>/projects.yaml). Works with any Hermes profile.\", \"tags\": [\"projects\", \"organization\", \"productivity\", \"workflow\", \"registry\"], \"related_skills\": [\"hermes-workspace-context\", \"hermes-agent\"], \"content\": \"---\\nname: projects\\ndescription: >-\\n  Generic per-profile project registry for organizing and tracking work across\\n  any domain. Create, list, switch, annotate, and filter projects by status\\n  and category. Data lives per-profile (~/.hermes/projects.yaml or\\n  ~/.hermes/profiles/<name>/projects.yaml). Works with any Hermes profile.\\nversion: 1.0.0\\nauthor: Hermes Agent\\nlicense: MIT\\nplatforms: [linux, macos, windows]\\nmetadata:\\n  hermes:\\n    tags: [projects, organization, productivity, wor...","status":"ok","task_id":"9aa7e4ed-9573-4b5f-81a1-c1979fb7e103","tool_call_id":"call_56da1922aec94dcfa8560052","tool_name":"skill_view","turn_id":"bdfb2d7c-28e8-404c-a670-921b0f807430:9aa7e4ed-9573-4b5f-81a1-c1979fb7e103:ad4183ac"},"sessionId":"bdfb2d7c-28e8-404c-a670-921b0f807430","timestamp":"2026-06-18T17:38:24.753008+00:00"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqjsajkg_59fd18cfa331":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mqjsajkg_59fd18cfa331","raw":{"args_preview":"{\"action\":\"patch\",\"name\":\"projects\",\"new_string\":\"### Workspace Scaffolding\\n\\nWhen creating a new project, scaffold a workspace directory structure alongside\\nthe registry entry. The directory layout is domain-specific \\u2014 pick subdirectories\\nthat match how the work actually flows.\\n\\n**Pattern:**\\n1. Create `workspace/<project-name>/` under the profile's path (or under `path:` if set)\\n2. Create domain-appropriate subdirectories (see below)\\n3. Write a `notes/brief.md` with: specs, workflo...","duration_ms":13,"error_message":null,"is_error":false,"result_preview":"{\"success\": true, \"message\": \"Patched SKILL.md in skill 'projects' (1 replacement).\", \"_change\": {\"old\": \"### Recommended Workflows\\n\\n#### Session startup — auto-detect project context\", \"new\": \"### Workspace Scaffolding\\n\\nWhen creating a new project, scaffold a workspace directory structure alongside\\nthe registry entry. The directory layout is domain-specific — pick subdirectories\\nthat match …\"}}","status":"ok","task_id":"9aa7e4ed-9573-4b5f-81a1-c1979fb7e103","tool_call_id":"call_e0a2ce6663da4050a09f1e10","tool_name":"skill_manage","turn_id":"bdfb2d7c-28e8-404c-a670-921b0f807430:9aa7e4ed-9573-4b5f-81a1-c1979fb7e103:ad4183ac"},"sessionId":"bdfb2d7c-28e8-404c-a670-921b0f807430","timestamp":"2026-06-18T17:38:49.357558+00:00"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqjsfckt_d25828cb4651":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mqjsfckt_d25828cb4651","raw":{"args_preview":"{\"query\":\"move-session command database\",\"limit\":5}","duration_ms":20,"error_message":null,"is_error":false,"result_preview":"{\"success\": true, \"mode\": \"discover\", \"query\": \"move-session command database\", \"results\": [{\"session_id\": \"20260616_231956_f91c35\", \"when\": \"June 16, 2026 at 11:20 PM\", \"source\": \"tui\", \"model\": \"kilo-auto/balanced\", \"title\": \"Merging sessions\", \"matched_role\": \"assistant\", \"match_message_id\": 6350, \"snippet\": \"Hermes doesn't have a built-in \\\"merge sessions\\\" or \\\">>>move session<<< to profile\\\" CLI >>>command<<< out of the box. However, since Hermes stores sessions in a standard SQLite >>>database<<<, we can easily move them behind the scenes!\\n\\nI just...\", \"bookend_start\": [{\"id\": 6315, \"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"can sessions be merged in Hermes, all of these agentmemory session should be in the agentmemory profile at lease.\", \"timestamp\": 1781670050.3226979}], \"messages\": [{\"id\": 6346, \"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"\", \"timestamp\": 1781670224.200877, \"tool_calls\": [{\"id\": \"call_c305cff3637e4ebc80836def\", \"call_id\": \"call_c305cff3637e4ebc80836def\", \"response_item_id\": \"fc_c305c...","status":"ok","task_id":"bdfb2d7c-28e8-404c-a670-921b0f807430","tool_call_id":"call_5ba10465d2f74161a74b89c4","tool_name":"session_search","turn_id":"bdfb2d7c-28e8-404c-a670-921b0f807430:bdfb2d7c-28e8-404c-a670-921b0f807430:4482ec14"},"sessionId":"bdfb2d7c-28e8-404c-a670-921b0f807430","timestamp":"2026-06-18T17:42:33.579043+00:00"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqjsfgww_b779ee8df548":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mqjsfgww_b779ee8df548","raw":{"args_preview":"{\"command\":\"cat ~/.hermes/scripts/session_manager.py\"}","duration_ms":106,"error_message":null,"is_error":false,"result_preview":"{\"output\": \"#!/usr/bin/env python3\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nSession move/merge utility for Hermes.\\n\\nUsage: \\n  session_manager.py <action> [options]\\n\\nActions:\\n  move <target_profile> <session_id> [<session_id>...] [--delete]\\n      Copies sessions from the current/default profile to the target profile.\\n      Use --delete to also remove them from the source profile after copying.\\n      \\n  merge <target_session_id> <source_session_id> [<source_session_id>...]\\n      Appends all messages from source session(s) into the target session.\\n      Source sessions are preserved.\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport sqlite3\\nimport sys\\nimport os\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\n\\ndef get_db_path(profile=None):\\n    if profile:\\n        return Path.home() / \\\".hermes\\\" / \\\"profiles\\\" / profile / \\\"state.db\\\"\\n    return Path.home() / \\\".hermes\\\" / \\\"state.db\\\"\\n\\ndef move_sessions(target_profile, session_ids, delete_source=False):\\n    src_db = get_db_path()\\n    tgt_db = get_db_path(target_profile)\\n    \\n    if not src_db.exists...","status":"ok","task_id":"bdfb2d7c-28e8-404c-a670-921b0f807430","tool_call_id":"call_5eeeef967b7f4d93a6ecca02","tool_name":"terminal","turn_id":"bdfb2d7c-28e8-404c-a670-921b0f807430:bdfb2d7c-28e8-404c-a670-921b0f807430:4482ec14"},"sessionId":"bdfb2d7c-28e8-404c-a670-921b0f807430","timestamp":"2026-06-18T17:42:39.197892+00:00"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqjsl7oe_c6c36932ab58":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mqjsl7oe_c6c36932ab58","raw":{"args_preview":"{\"name\":\"hermes-agent\"}","duration_ms":19,"error_message":null,"is_error":false,"result_preview":"{\"success\": true, \"name\": \"hermes-agent\", \"description\": \"Configure, extend, or contribute to Hermes Agent.\", \"tags\": [\"hermes\", \"setup\", \"configuration\", \"multi-agent\", \"spawning\", \"cli\", \"gateway\", \"development\"], \"related_skills\": [\"claude-code\", \"codex\", \"opencode\"], \"content\": \"---\\nname: hermes-agent\\ndescription: \\\"Configure, extend, or contribute to Hermes Agent.\\\"\\nversion: 2.1.0\\nauthor: Hermes Agent + Teknium\\nlicense: MIT\\nplatforms: [linux, macos, windows]\\nmetadata:\\n  hermes:\\n    tags: [hermes, setup, configuration, multi-agent, spawning, cli, gateway, development]\\n    homepage: https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent\\n    related_skills: [claude-code, codex, opencode]\\n---\\n\\n# Hermes Agent\\n\\nHermes Agent is an open-source AI agent framework by Nous Research that runs in your terminal, messaging platforms, and IDEs. It belongs to the same category as Claude Code (Anthropic), Codex (OpenAI), and OpenClaw — autonomous coding and task-execution agents that use tool...","status":"ok","task_id":"4df88210-f9a8-4d77-b1b3-c024e9584570","tool_call_id":"call_21fdfa71438c4123bfd2ab17","tool_name":"skill_view","turn_id":"bdfb2d7c-28e8-404c-a670-921b0f807430:4df88210-f9a8-4d77-b1b3-c024e9584570:e974a140"},"sessionId":"bdfb2d7c-28e8-404c-a670-921b0f807430","timestamp":"2026-06-18T17:47:07.163950+00:00"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqjsm9m8_7c2d1f85cf3b":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mqjsm9m8_7c2d1f85cf3b","raw":{"args_preview":"{\"action\":\"patch\",\"name\":\"hermes-workspace-context\",\"new_string\":\"**Pitfalls:**\\n- Do not manually edit `messages_fts` tables \\u2014 triggers handle search index updates\\n- Profile switching requires a restart to see migrated sessions\\n- Leave source sessions intact until verified in the target profile\\n- **Duplicate cleanup for previously-copied sessions:** If sessions were already copied to the target (without `--delete`), a later `move --delete` will SKIP them (\\\"already exists in target\\\"). ...","duration_ms":13,"error_message":null,"is_error":false,"result_preview":"{\"success\": true, \"message\": \"Patched SKILL.md in skill 'hermes-workspace-context' (1 replacement).\", \"_change\": {\"old\": \"**Pitfalls:**\\n- Do not manually edit `messages_fts` tables — triggers handle search index updates\\n- Profile switching requires a restart to see migrated sessions\\n- Leave source sessions intact until v…\", \"new\": \"**Pitfalls:**\\n- Do not manually edit `messages_fts` tables — triggers handle search index updates\\n- Profile switching requires a restart to see migrated sessions\\n- Leave source sessions intact until v…\"}}","status":"ok","task_id":"4df88210-f9a8-4d77-b1b3-c024e9584570","tool_call_id":"call_9c7b113f83c04961abda435c","tool_name":"skill_manage","turn_id":"bdfb2d7c-28e8-404c-a670-921b0f807430:4df88210-f9a8-4d77-b1b3-c024e9584570:e974a140"},"sessionId":"bdfb2d7c-28e8-404c-a670-921b0f807430","timestamp":"2026-06-18T17:47:56.334344+00:00"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqjsmwr0_10d3c13c14a3":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mqjsmwr0_10d3c13c14a3","raw":{"args_preview":"{\"command\":\"which cnc && cat $(which cnc) 2>/dev/null || echo \\\"Not found - recreating...\\\" && cat ~/.local/bin/cnc 2>/dev/null || echo \\\"Doesn't exist yet\\\"\"}","duration_ms":103,"error_message":null,"is_error":false,"result_preview":"{\"output\": \"/Users/davec/.local/bin/cnc\\n#!/bin/sh\\nexec /Users/davec/.local/bin/hermes -p cnc \\\"$@\\\"\\n#!/bin/sh\\nexec /Users/davec/.local/bin/hermes -p cnc \\\"$@\\\"\", \"exit_code\": 0,